{"id":"n60ef145a4f","headline":"Pyshny allows for PrivatBank, Oschadbank privatization","summary":"National Bank of Ukraine Governor Andriy Pyshny did not rule out privatising the state-owned PrivatBank and Oschadbank. He said any such decision should be part of a broader state banking strategy.","why":"PrivatBank and Oschadbank are major state-owned Ukrainian lenders. Privatisation plans affect the structure, governance and value of the country's banking sector.","category":"companies","event_type":"regulation","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Kyiv","country":"Ukraine","lat":50.45,"lon":30.523,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Interfax-Ukraine","url":"https://en.interfax.com.ua/news/economic/1177724.html"},"sources":[{"name":"Interfax-Ukraine","url":"https://en.interfax.com.ua/news/economic/1177724.html"}],"published_at":"2026-06-18T17:36:46Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"beff5b066882d6af","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-18T17:36:46Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-18T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"UP","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-4540480.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"Glavo","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/western-city-spain-tabernas-tourism-4540480/"}}